<title>USA: Presstek Inc Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Presstek Inc Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HUDSON, N.H. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					 Sep 28  Sep 30  Sep 28   Sep30</p>
<p>					   1996    1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   $12,366  $7,629 $35,251 $18,216</p>
<p> Costs and Expenses		 9,680   6,740  27,892  17,147</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes     2,831     953   7,847   1,314</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes(A)  1,000	81   3,080     105</p>
<p> Net Income			   1,831     872   4,767   1,209</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		 .11     .05     .29     .08</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number Common Equivalent Shares</p>
<p>					 16,459  16,067  16,511  15,838</p>
<p>NOTE(A): The provision for income taxes in 1996 relates principally to a charge in lieu of income taxes arising during the period from employee stock options, based upon the estimated effective income tax rate for the full fiscal year. The tax benefit related to such stock options has been credited to stockholders' equity.</p>
<p>The provision for income taxes in 1995 represents the charge in lieu of state income taxes from employee stock options.  No charge for federal income taxes was required in 1995 due to the availability of federal net operating loss carryforwards for accounting purposes.</p>
<p>(in thousands, except Per Share)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
